      "comment": "LADY POTATO HEAD (5) returns from a long break and makes her stable debut for the Potiris camp. Her Victorian form reads strongly for this, though first look at 950m is a clear unknown. DEVINE FORCE (4) is the proven local, unbeaten as a placegetter from four tries at this track and distance and last seen winning a BM60 at this venue on heavy ground. COLONEL PARKER (3) was highly consistent last campaign, winning at Townsville before going under by just over half a length, and his 950m placing record keeps him firmly in calculations. SUGARFIRE (6) resumes with solid 12-month form though is yet to fire fresh. FRILLY FILLY (8) got off the mark immediately at the latest and should've come on from that but this is obviously tougher.",
